","Overload Prios":"Overload Prios","OPEleDmgDealt":"","OPHitRate":"","OPMaxAmmo":"","OPATK":"","OPChDMG":"","OPChSpeed":"","OPCRate":"","OPCDMG":"","OPDFEF":"","OPPrio":"","OPNotes":"","roles":"Offensive Support, Cover Repair","summary":"Works good in her niche pierce teams, however still outshadowed by the top tier burst II supports even in pierce teams. Pairs better with Snow white and Maxwell.","id":126},"tierlist2":{"name":"Zwei (Treasure)","Tier List":"Tier List","Combined":"A","Story":"A","Boss":"S","PvP":"B","Wishlist":"","isNew":"FALSE","reqHands":"FALSE","reqInvest":"FALSE","strongEarly":"FALSE","Cube Reqs":"Cube Reqs","cubes":"Resilience Cube, Destruction Cube","cubeNotes":"If using her burst active, she can take advantage of either Piercing Cube or Destruction Cube to deal bonus damage to a boss.\nWithout Burst active, Resilience is fine to allow her to keep stacking Pierce Damage for the team, since it happens with every shot.","Skill Prios":"Skill Prios","SkillPrioPvp":"FALSE","SkillPrioBudget":"4/4/4","SkillPrioReq":"7/10/7","SkillPrioOrder":"S1 = S2","SkillPrioImportance":"Medium","SkillPrioNotes":"Skill 1 now has a component where Zwei gives allies Pierce Damage for one shot if shooting during Full Burst, off-burst or not. Since more shooting keeps generating this buff, it's not just notable to buff for a single high-damage Pierce Damage shot, but effectively like a second Pierce Damage buff to everyone but fast firing weapons with Pierce capabilities. \n\nSkill 2 provides such a huge critical rate to the whole team, but it only works if she's allowed to burst. Combined with base crit rate of 15%, everyone will have a minimum of 78% crit rate. With enough Burst gen, it's also possible to make the critical rate buff effectively permanent as well. Recommended to max, as it's the most unique way to buff DPS as of yet, can have functionality even for non-Pierce units. \n\nBurst still switches her weapon and provides the team with a Pierce Damage buff; however, it doesn't scale as well as the Pierce buff from S1 for slower-firing allies, and her Burst Active still deals very poor damage. ","Overload Prios":"Overload Prios","OPEleDmgDealt":"","OPHitRate":"","OPMaxAmmo":"","OPATK":"","OPChDMG":"","OPChSpeed":"","OPCRate":"","OPCDMG":"","OPDFEF":"","OPPrio":"","OPNotes":"","roles":"Support, Buffer","summary":null,"id":196},"recommendations":null,"overloadrecs":null,"dollskills":[{"id":2390151,"name":"Pierce Equation","description":"■ Activates when entering Full Burst. Affects all allies.\n<color=#00AEFF><word_group=10042>Pierce Damage</word_group> ▲ {description_value_01}% for {description_value_02} round(s).\n<word_group=10042>Pierce Damage</word_group> ▲ {description_value_03}% for {description_value_04} sec.</color>\n■ Activates when performing a normal attack during Full Burst. Affects all allies.\n<color=#00AEFF><word_group=10042>Pierce Damage</word_group> ▲ {description_value_05}%, stacks up to {description_value_06} time(s), for {description_value_07} round(s).</color>","icon":"icn_skill_penetrationdamage_01","cooldown":"","levels":[{"description_value_01":"11.89","description_value_02":"1","description_value_03":"5.94","description_value_04":"10","description_value_05":"14.76","description_value_06":"3","description_value_07":"1"},{"description_value_01":"12.81","description_value_02":"1","description_value_03":"6.4","description_value_04":"10","description_value_05":"15.9","description_value_06":"3","description_value_07":"1"},{"description_value_01":"13.72","description_value_02":"1","description_value_03":"6.86","description_value_04":"10","description_value_05":"17.04","description_value_06":"3","description_value_07":"1"},{"description_value_01":"14.64","description_value_02":"1","description_value_03":"7.32","description_value_04":"10","description_value_05":"18.17","description_value_06":"3","description_value_07":"1"},{"description_value_01":"15.55","description_value_02":"1","description_value_03":"7